{"title":"Round Dial Smart Watches","description":"","products":[{"product_id":"armour-smart-watch","title":"Zero Armour Smartwatch","description":"\u003cp\u003eWith Armour, experience a new world of exceptional visuals that makes everything clearer. 1.32” of LCD display and 500 nits brightness that truly transforms your \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003esmartwatch \u003c\/a\u003eexperience.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Camou Grey","offer_id":49817081053462,"sku":"23122","price":8499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Blue","offer_id":49817081020694,"sku":"23024","price":8499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Jet Black","offer_id":45337362366742,"sku":"18971","price":8499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Teal Green","offer_id":45337362432278,"sku":"18972","price":8499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Misty Gray","offer_id":45337362399510,"sku":"18973","price":8499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/PSD01_02.webp?v=1742630454"},{"product_id":"orbit-smart-watch","title":"Orbit Smart Watch","description":"\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eZero Orbit smartwatch is your for-life companions. They’re techy, aesthetically alluring, and functionally on-spot! All the basic smartphone functionality is always tied around your wrist, and to make it even better.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"BLUE","offer_id":45375550128406,"sku":"18931","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"GOLD BLACK","offer_id":45375550161174,"sku":"18933","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"BLACK SPORTY RED RINGS","offer_id":45375550095638,"sku":"18930","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"BLACK SPORTY GRAY RINGS","offer_id":45375550193942,"sku":"18932","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/products\/e5f5dew.png?v=1690663665"},{"product_id":"revolt-smart-watch","title":"Revoltt Smartwatch","description":"\u003cp\u003eStep into luxury with Revoltt Smart Watch: Sleek Stainless Steel, Durable Metallic Body, \u0026amp; Advanced Health Suite. Premium tech for your elite lifestyle!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eRevolt Smartwatch Product Description\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Revolt Smartwatch is designed for those who demand cutting-edge technology and sleek design in their wearable devices.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003esmartwatch \u003c\/a\u003eis your ultimate tool for staying connected, tracking your health, and boosting your daily productivity. Whether you're in a meeting, at the gym, or out with friends, the Revolt Smartwatch fits effortlessly into your routine.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Revolt Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Revolt Smartwatch comes with a robust set of features to keep you ahead. Track your fitness with precision using its advanced sensors for heart rate monitoring, sleep analysis, and various sports modes.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStay updated with smart notifications for calls, texts, and apps, all visible on a clear, high-resolution display. The long-lasting battery ensures you’re always ready for action, and with customizable watch faces and interchangeable straps, you can easily match your watch to your outfit and mood.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Revolt Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDisplay: 1.4-inch AMOLED full touch screen\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eResolution: 400 x 400 pixels\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSensors: Heart rate monitor, SpO2 monitor, accelerometer, gyroscope\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCompatibility: iOS and Android\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStrap Material: Silicone (interchangeable)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDimensions: 47 x 39 x 11 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConnectivity: Bluetooth 5.0\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBattery Life: Up to 10 days\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWater Resistance: IP68 rating\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWeight: 42g\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Revolt SmartWatch?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eChoosing the Luna Smartwatch means embracing a device that enhances your life with its high-end features and stylish design. Its comprehensive health tracking, seamless connectivity, and customizable appearance make it a standout choice in the smartwatch market. Plus, our dedicated customer support ensures you have a smooth experience from purchase to everyday use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eDo you have any ongoing sales?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes! Take advantage of our \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/11-11-sale\"\u003e11.11 Sale\u003c\/a\u003e for exclusive discounts on smartwatches and earbuds.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Gun Metal","offer_id":46539391664406,"sku":"19819","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Silver","offer_id":46539391631638,"sku":"19820","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Gold","offer_id":46539391598870,"sku":"19818","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Blue","offer_id":48949103558934,"sku":"22463","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/RevoltGolden01.webp?v=1736870078"},{"product_id":"luna-smart-watch","title":"Luna Smartwatch","description":"\u003cp\u003eSwitch towards infinite possibilities with the Luna Smartwatch, styled through a cosmic full metal body with a 1.39” HD Display and IP67 Water Resistance. With a fully functioning AI Assistant, Luna keeps you connected at every moment. Strap into the future of smartwatches with Active Weather Forecasting, BT Calling, and sleek strap designs.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Luna:\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e1.39” HD Display\u003cbr\u003eIP67 Water Resistance\u003cbr\u003eActive Weather Forecasting\u003cbr\u003eBT Calling\u003cbr\u003eSmart Notifications\u003cbr\u003eActive Health Suites\u003cbr\u003eWorkout Modes\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Luna:\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDisplay\u003c\/strong\u003e: Full-color touch screen\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHealth Tracking\u003c\/strong\u003e: Heart rate monitor, sleep analysis\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eActivity Tracking\u003c\/strong\u003e: Steps, calories, various exercise modes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eConnectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e: Smart notifications for calls, texts, and social media\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBattery Life\u003c\/strong\u003e: Long-lasting, multi-day battery life on a single charge\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCustomization\u003c\/strong\u003e: Multiple customizable watch faces\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eDo you have any ongoing sales?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes! Take advantage of our \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/11-11-sale\"\u003e11.11 Sale\u003c\/a\u003e for exclusive discounts on \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003esmartwatches\u003c\/a\u003e and earbuds.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":47069797450006,"sku":"20081","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Gray","offer_id":47069797548310,"sku":"20080","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black Gold","offer_id":47069797515542,"sku":"20084","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Pink Gold","offer_id":47069797482774,"sku":"20077","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue","offer_id":48148570308886,"sku":"20680","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Sporty Gray Rings","offer_id":48926634311958,"sku":"22477","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Sporty Red Rings","offer_id":48926630936854,"sku":"22479","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Luna-_5_3.webp?v=1776510284"},{"product_id":"matrix-smart-watch","title":"Matrix Pro AMOLED Smart Watch","description":"\u003cp\u003eUpgrade your lifestyle to the MAX with Matrix Smart Watch having a premium AMOLED Display, Pakistan's first Stainless-Steel Strap \u0026amp; a Functional Crown.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eMatrix Pro Smartwatch Product Description\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Matrix smartwatch is your ideal companion for staying connected, monitoring your health, and enhancing your daily activities. Whether you're at the office, the gym, or out on the town, the Matrix Smartwatch fits seamlessly into your lifestyle.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith advanced technology and a sleek look, the Vision Smartwatch offers both practicality and elegance in one wearable device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Matrix Pro Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Matrix Smartwatch is equipped with a range of features to keep you on track and connected. Its advanced fitness tracking includes heart rate monitoring, sleep analysis, and various sports modes.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStay updated with smart notifications for calls, messages, and social media alerts, all displayed on a vibrant, high-resolution screen. The long-lasting battery ensures you stay powered throughout your day, and customizable watch faces and interchangeable straps let you personalize your look.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Matrix Pro Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDisplay: 1.3-inch AMOLED full touch screen\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eResolution: 360 x 360 pixels\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSensors: Heart rate monitor, SpO2 monitor, accelerometer\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCompatibility: iOS and Android\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStrap Material: Silicone (interchangeable)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDimensions: 45 x 38 x 10 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConnectivity: Bluetooth 5.0\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBattery Life: Up to 8 days\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWater Resistance: IP67 rating\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWeight: 42g\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Matrix Pro SmartWatch?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOpting for the Matrix Smartwatch means choosing a device that enhances your life with its advanced features and stylish design. Its comprehensive health tracking, seamless connectivity, and elegant appearance make it a top choice. Plus, with our dedicated customer support, you can enjoy a hassle-free experience from purchase to daily use.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Forest Green","offer_id":47322178257174,"sku":"20140","price":12999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Gold","offer_id":47223445586198,"sku":"20138","price":12999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Misty Grey","offer_id":47322178224406,"sku":"20139","price":12999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Jet Black","offer_id":47322178191638,"sku":"20135","price":12999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Silver","offer_id":47223445553430,"sku":"20137","price":12999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black","offer_id":47223445520662,"sku":"20136","price":12999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/ProBlackTopviewwithstrapwithoutBG.webp?v=1706183349"},{"product_id":"nova-smart-watch","title":"Nova Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch2\u003eNova Smartwatch Product Description\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUpgrade your tech with the Nova Smartwatch, where innovation meets elegance. Make your daily routine more productive and stylish with a smartwatch designed to keep pace with your life. Order your Nova Smartwatch today and embrace the perfect blend of technology and fashion.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Nova Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Nova Smartwatch is equipped with a range of features to keep you on track and connected. Its advanced fitness tracking includes heart rate monitoring, sleep analysis, and various sports modes.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStay updated with smart notifications for calls, messages, and social media alerts, all displayed on a vibrant, high-resolution screen. The long-lasting battery ensures you stay powered throughout your day, and customizable watch faces and interchangeable straps let you personalize your look.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Nova Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDisplay: 1.3-inch TFT full touch screen\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eResolution: 360 x 360 pixels\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSensors: Heart rate monitor, SpO2 monitor, accelerometer, gyroscope\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCompatibility: iOS and Android\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStrap Material: Silicone (interchangeable)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDimensions: 45 x 38 x 10 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConnectivity: Bluetooth 5.0\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBattery Life: Up to 7 days\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWater Resistance: IP68 rating\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWeight: 40g\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Nova SmartWatch?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOpting for the Nova Smartwatch means choosing a device that enhances your life with its advanced features and stylish design. Its comprehensive health tracking, seamless connectivity, and elegant appearance make it a top choice. Plus, with our dedicated customer support, you can enjoy a hassle-free experience from purchase to daily use.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":47263090180374,"sku":"20096","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Golden","offer_id":47263090311446,"sku":"20101","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Blue","offer_id":47263090213142,"sku":"20097","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Nova Gray","offer_id":47263090344214,"sku":"20100","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Jet Black","offer_id":47263090245910,"sku":"20103","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Rainbow","offer_id":47263090278678,"sku":"20093","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Dark-Black.webp?v=1705740899"},{"product_id":"vision-smartwatch","title":"Vision Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch2\u003eVision Smartwatch Product Description\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExperience the perfect blend of innovation and style with the Vision Smartwatch. Designed for your busy lifestyle, this smartwatch keeps you connected and efficient throughout the day.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith advanced technology and a sleek look, the Vision \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eSmartwatch in Pakistan\u003c\/a\u003e offers both practicality and elegance in one wearable device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Vision Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Vision Smartwatch boasts an impressive suite of features designed to keep you at the top of your game.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStay healthy with comprehensive fitness tracking, including heart rate monitoring, sleep analysis, and multi-sport modes.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStay connected effortlessly with smart notifications for calls, messages, and apps right on your wrist.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIts high-definition display ensures clarity and vibrancy, while the robust battery life keeps you powered for days.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCustomizable watch faces and straps let you personalize your smartwatch to suit any look, whether you're at the gym or a formal event.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Vision Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDisplay: 1.3-inch AMOLED full touch screen\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eResolution: 360 x 360 pixels\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSensors: Heart rate monitor, SpO2 monitor, accelerometer\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCompatibility: iOS and Android\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStrap Material: Silicone (interchangeable)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDimensions: 45 x 38 x 11 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConnectivity: Bluetooth 5.0\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBattery Life: Up to 10 days\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWater Resistance: IP67 rating\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWeight: 42g\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Vision SmartWatch?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eChoosing the Vision Smartwatch means opting for a device that enhances your life in every possible way.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith its advanced features, high-quality construction, and stylish design, this smartwatch is a standout in its category.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt not only helps you manage your health and stay connected but also complements your fashion sense.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur dedicated customer support ensures a seamless experience from purchase to everyday use, providing peace of mind with every wear.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":48261650546966,"sku":"20147","price":9499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Gray Silver","offer_id":48261650514198,"sku":"20148","price":9499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue Silver","offer_id":48261650612502,"sku":"20151","price":9499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black Gold","offer_id":48261650579734,"sku":"20150","price":9499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Beige Gold","offer_id":48261650678038,"sku":"20149","price":9499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/vision_Black_1.webp?v=1771398223"},{"product_id":"vogue-smartwatch","title":"Vogue Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch2\u003eVogue Smart Watch Description!\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Vogue Smartwatch from ZeroLifestyle is a perfect blend of style, functionality, and durability. Designed for fitness enthusiasts and busy professionals alike, this smartwatch offers a plethora of features to keep you connected and on top of your health goals.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Vogue Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Vogue \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eSmartwatch \u003c\/a\u003ecomes with a vivid full-color touch display that remains clear even under bright sunlight.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIts comfortable, lightweight strap ensures it can be worn all day. Key features include continuous heart rate monitoring, sleep analysis, and tracking for various activities like walking, running, and cycling.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt also includes a step counter and calorie tracker, helping you stay on top of your fitness goals. Smart notifications allow you to receive calls, texts, and social media alerts directly on your wrist, ensuring you never miss an important message.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Vogue Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDisplay: Full-color touch screen\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHealth Tracking: Heart rate monitor, sleep analysis\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eActivity Tracking: Steps, calories, various exercise modes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eConnectivity: Smart notifications for calls, texts, and social media\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Life: Multi-day battery life\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWater Resistance: Suitable for intense workouts\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCustomization: Multiple watch faces\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eDo you have any ongoing sales?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes! Take advantage of our \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/11-11-sale\"\u003e11.11 Sale\u003c\/a\u003e for exclusive discounts on smartwatches and earbuds.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Silver","offer_id":48892245508374,"sku":"20684","price":14999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black","offer_id":48892245377302,"sku":"20683","price":14999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Gold Blue","offer_id":48892245475606,"sku":"20685","price":14999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black Gold","offer_id":48892245410070,"sku":"20687","price":14999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Gold Black","offer_id":48892245442838,"sku":"20686","price":14999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Vogue_Silver_0000.webp?v=1742632877"},{"product_id":"pixel-smartwatch","title":"Pixel Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch2\u003ePixel Smartwatch Product Description\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMeet the Pixel Smartwatch, the ultimate fusion of technology and style, designed to simplify and enhance your everyday life.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePerfect for those who demand both functionality and elegance in their wearable tech, the Pixel Smartwatch offers a seamless user experience with its intuitive features and sophisticated design.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Pixel Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Pixel Smartwatch is packed with features to help you stay on top of your health and connected to what matters most.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMonitor your fitness with advanced tracking capabilities, including heart rate monitoring, sleep analysis, and multiple sports modes. Stay updated with smart notifications for calls, texts, and apps, all accessible from your wrist.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStay connected effortlessly with smart notifications for calls, messages, and apps right on your wrist.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIts vibrant, high-resolution display ensures everything is crystal clear, while the long-lasting battery keeps you powered through your day. With customizable watch faces and interchangeable straps, you can personalize your Pixel Smartwatch to match any outfit or occasion.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Pixel Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDisplay: 1.4-inch AMOLED full touch screen\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eResolution: 360 x 360 pixels\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSensors: Heart rate monitor, SpO2 monitor, accelerometer, gyroscope\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCompatibility: iOS and Android\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStrap Material: Silicone (interchangeable)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDimensions: 46 x 38 x 11 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConnectivity: Bluetooth 5.0\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBattery Life: Up to 7 days\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWater Resistance: IP68 rating\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWeight: 40g\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Pixel SmartWatch?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eChoosing the Pixel Smartwatch means opting for a device that seamlessly integrates into your life. Its comprehensive features, high-quality build, and stylish design make it a standout choice.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhether you're tracking your fitness, staying connected, or simply enhancing your style, the Pixel Smartwatch delivers. Plus, our dedicated customer support ensures you have a smooth experience from purchase to everyday use.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Rainbow Gold","offer_id":48544548913430,"sku":"20449","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Golden","offer_id":48543732826390,"sku":"20153","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Silver","offer_id":48543732760854,"sku":"20154","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black","offer_id":48543732728086,"sku":"20152","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/3_1_-1.png?v=1717406207"},{"product_id":"royale-smartwatch","title":"Royale Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch2\u003eRoyale Smart Watch Description!\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Royale Smartwatch from ZeroLifestyle is a perfect blend of style, functionality, and durability. Designed for fitness enthusiasts and busy professionals alike, this smartwatch offers a plethora of features to keep you connected and on top of your health goals.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Royale Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Royale \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eSmart watch in Pakistan\u003c\/a\u003e comes with a vivid full-color touch display that remains clear even under bright sunlight.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIts comfortable, lightweight strap ensures it can be worn all day. Key features include continuous heart rate monitoring, sleep analysis, and tracking for various activities like walking, running, and cycling.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt also includes a step counter and calorie tracker, helping you stay on top of your fitness goals. Smart notifications allow you to receive calls, texts, and social media alerts directly on your wrist, ensuring you never miss an important message.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Royale Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDisplay: Full-color touch screen\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHealth Tracking: Heart rate monitor, sleep analysis\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eActivity Tracking: Steps, calories, various exercise modes\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConnectivity: Smart notifications for calls, texts, and social media\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBattery Life: Multi-day battery life\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWater Resistance: Suitable for intense workouts\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCustomization: Multiple watch faces\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Royale Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Royale Smartwatch offers comprehensive tracking features to provide valuable insights into your daily activities and sleep patterns.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis enables you to make informed decisions about your health. Its ability to receive notifications directly on your wrist ensures continuous connectivity.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith its sleek design and customizable watch faces, the Royale Smartwatch is a versatile accessory for any occasion.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eDo you have any ongoing sales?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes! Take advantage of our \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/11-11-sale\"\u003e11.11 Sale\u003c\/a\u003e for exclusive discounts on smartwatches and earbuds.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Titanium Silver","offer_id":48816729587990,"sku":"20689","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Golden Metal","offer_id":48816729555222,"sku":"20690","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black Strap","offer_id":48816729620758,"sku":"20942","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Blue Strap","offer_id":48816729653526,"sku":"20943","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black Metal","offer_id":48816729522454,"sku":"20688","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Royale_Black_0000_4bb22ca9-fa60-4044-8cc1-fbf9e718b57a.webp?v=1725970013"},{"product_id":"regal-smartwatch","title":"Regal AI Smartwatch","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Regal Smartwatch is an elegant fusion of style and innovation. Its sleek, modern design and durable construction make it a versatile accessory for any occasion, whether you're at work, out casually, or hitting the gym.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eStylish and Durable Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e Sleek, modern finish with sturdy construction.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVivid AMOLED Display:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1.19-inch screen with customizable menu views.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLong-Lasting Battery Life:\u003c\/strong\u003e 5–7 days of regular use and up to 25–30 days on standby. Quick 2-hour charging.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHealth and Fitness Tracking:\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeart Rate Monitoring\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBlood Pressure Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSpO2 Level Measurement\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSleep Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStress Management Tools\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMenstrual Cycle Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e107 Sports Modes:\u003c\/strong\u003e Tracks performance across various activities including running, cycling, and yoga.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eStay Connected:\u003c\/strong\u003e Handle calls, messages, and notifications from your wrist.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVoice Assistant Compatibility:\u003c\/strong\u003e Interact with Google Assistant or Siri.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBuilt-In Entertainment:\u003c\/strong\u003e Includes 4 fun games like Flappy Bird and 2048.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEveryday Tools:\u003c\/strong\u003e Alarms, weather updates, flashlight, and calculator.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDisplay:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1.19-inch AMOLED screen.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBattery Life:\u003c\/strong\u003e 5–7 days of regular use, 25–30 days on standby.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e 2 hours.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHealth Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e Heart rate monitor, blood pressure tracker, SpO2 level measurement, sleep tracking, stress management, menstrual cycle tracking.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSports Modes:\u003c\/strong\u003e 107 modes including running, cycling, yoga.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eConnectivity:\u003c\/strong\u003e Calls, messages, notifications, music playback, call records, find phone.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVoice Assistant:\u003c\/strong\u003e Google Assistant, Siri.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eGames:\u003c\/strong\u003e 4 built-in games.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAdditional Tools:\u003c\/strong\u003e Alarms, weather updates, flashlight, calculator.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Regal Smartwatch?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Regal \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eSmartwatch \u003c\/a\u003eis the perfect blend of sophistication and smart innovation. With its stylish design, comprehensive health tracking features, and a suite of practical and entertainment tools, it seamlessly fits into your daily life. Whether you're focused on fitness, staying organized, or just having some fun, the Regal Smartwatch is your ideal companion, ready to step into the future with you!\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Copper Silver","offer_id":50270222516502,"sku":"22552","price":18499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Obsidian Gold","offer_id":50372312826134,"sku":"22554","price":18499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Rose Gold","offer_id":49685919531286,"sku":"22550","price":18499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Aqua Silver","offer_id":49685919465750,"sku":"22556","price":18499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Emerald Silver","offer_id":49685919432982,"sku":"22558","price":18499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Racing Red Silver","offer_id":49685919498518,"sku":"22548","price":18499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/CopperSilver_1.webp?v=1756127463"},{"product_id":"jewel-smartwatch","title":"Jewel Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch1\u003eJewel Smartwatch\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eStylish and Durable Design\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExquisitely engineered with a robust Zinc alloy shell combined with PC and ABS elements. Available in two variants—Jewel (with a lightweight profile of 30g\/44g strap options) and Jewel SE (83g with a premium steel band)—this smartwatch is built to complement your style without weighing you down.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eVivid AMOLED Display\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEnjoy a 1.1-inch AMOLED screen with a crisp 360×360 resolution that delivers vibrant visuals and excellent clarity for day-to-day interactions.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eReliable Battery Performance\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePowered by a polymer battery (230mAh), the Jewel \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eSmartwatch \u003c\/a\u003eoffers 5–7 days of active use alongside up to 20 days on standby. A swift charge in just 2 hours gets you back on track without missing a beat.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eHealth and Fitness Tracking\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeart Rate Monitoring\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBlood Pressure Monitoring\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSpO2 Measurement\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSleep Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBreathe Training\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMenstrual Cycle Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCalories Consumption Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eStay Connected\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEffortlessly manage calls, notifications, and alerts directly from your wrist. With seamless contact synchronization, call records, and split-screen functionalities, the Jewel Smartwatch ensures you never miss an important moment.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eEveryday Tools\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCustomize your experience using over 300 cloud-based watch faces—with 5 built-in options and DIY support—and choose from 110+ sports modes (8 built-in). Additional smart tools include voice assistant support through Google Assistant and Siri, camera control for capturing life’s moments, weather updates, alarms, calculator, LCD brightness adjustments, theater\/DND mode, motion gesture activation, and essential reminders for sedentary behavior and hydration.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDisplay: 1.1-inch AMOLED screen with 360×360 resolution.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Life: 5–7 days of active use, 20 days on standby.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging Time: 2 hours.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWater Resistance: IP67 rating for dependable durability.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOperating System: Compatible with Android 5.0+ and iOS 10+ (supporting Bluetooth 4.0).\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBluetooth Version: BLE 5.0 with a 10-meter transmission range.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Jewel Smartwatch?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Jewel Smartwatch offers an extraordinary blend of aesthetics, functionality, and smart connectivity. Whether you choose the classic Jewel or the premium Jewel SE, its refined design, comprehensive health tracking, and plethora of everyday tools ensure that you remain connected and in control—no matter if you’re working out, working hard, or winding down at the end of the day.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Golden Milannese","offer_id":49924661870870,"sku":"22900","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Gold Metal","offer_id":49924662001942,"sku":"22902","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Silver Metal","offer_id":49924662034710,"sku":"22910","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Pink Leather","offer_id":49924661936406,"sku":"22906","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Pearl White Leather","offer_id":49924661903638,"sku":"22904","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Silver Milannese","offer_id":49924662067478,"sku":"22908","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black Milannese","offer_id":49924661838102,"sku":"22896","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black Metal","offer_id":49924661969174,"sku":"22898","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Jewel_1_57b8f293-03c2-46be-9f76-79cf4af38c09.webp?v=1773449006"},{"product_id":"orbit-2","title":"Orbit 2 Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch3 data-end=\"159\" data-start=\"117\"\u003eOrbit 2 Smartwatch by Zero Lifestyle\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-end=\"187\" data-start=\"161\"\u003eFeatures of Product\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"361\" data-start=\"189\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"217\" data-start=\"189\"\u003eSleek and Durable Design\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-end=\"220\" data-start=\"217\"\u003eThe Orbit 2 Smartwatch is crafted to match both style and function, featuring a 1.38-inch round TFT screen with a sharp 240×240 resolution.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"705\" data-start=\"362\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"495\" data-start=\"362\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"495\" data-start=\"364\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"382\" data-start=\"364\"\u003ePremium Build:\u003c\/strong\u003e Zinc alloy middle frame, PC plastic bottom case, and anti-static silicone strap ensure durability and comfort.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"577\" data-start=\"496\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"577\" data-start=\"498\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"521\" data-start=\"498\"\u003eCompact Dimensions:\u003c\/strong\u003e Designed for a perfect wrist fit without adding bulk.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"705\" data-start=\"578\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"705\" data-start=\"580\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"606\" data-start=\"580\"\u003eIP68 Water Resistance:\u003c\/strong\u003e Withstands daily splashes, sweat, and rain, making it ideal for workouts and outdoor adventures.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"820\" data-start=\"712\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"753\" data-start=\"712\"\u003ePowerful Battery \u0026amp; Efficient Charging\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-end=\"756\" data-start=\"753\"\u003eStay powered through busy days with a reliable battery system.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"1063\" data-start=\"821\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"897\" data-start=\"821\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"897\" data-start=\"823\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"840\" data-start=\"823\"\u003eExtended Use:\u003c\/strong\u003e 5–7 days of working time and up to 15 days on standby.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"956\" data-start=\"898\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"956\" data-start=\"900\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"919\" data-start=\"900\"\u003eQuick Recharge:\u003c\/strong\u003e Fully charges in just 2.5–3 hours.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1063\" data-start=\"957\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1063\" data-start=\"959\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"980\" data-start=\"959\"\u003eReliable Battery:\u003c\/strong\u003e 220mAh polymer battery with Seiko board protection for long-lasting performance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1182\" data-start=\"1070\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1104\" data-start=\"1070\"\u003eSeamless Wireless Connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-end=\"1107\" data-start=\"1104\"\u003eEnjoy smooth pairing and stable connections for all your smart functions.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"1435\" data-start=\"1183\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1271\" data-start=\"1183\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1271\" data-start=\"1185\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1214\" data-start=\"1185\"\u003eLatest Bluetooth Version:\u003c\/strong\u003e Equipped with BLE 5.3 for fast, reliable transmission.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1335\" data-start=\"1272\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1335\" data-start=\"1274\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1293\" data-start=\"1274\"\u003eGenerous Range:\u003c\/strong\u003e Maintains connectivity up to 10 meters.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1435\" data-start=\"1336\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1435\" data-start=\"1338\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1362\" data-start=\"1338\"\u003eSmart Notifications:\u003c\/strong\u003e Stay on top of calls, messages, and app alerts directly on your wrist.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1551\" data-start=\"1442\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1480\" data-start=\"1442\"\u003eAdvanced Health \u0026amp; Fitness Tracking\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-end=\"1483\" data-start=\"1480\"\u003eTake charge of your health with comprehensive monitoring features.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"1956\" data-start=\"1552\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1595\" data-start=\"1552\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1595\" data-start=\"1554\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1593\" data-start=\"1554\"\u003eHeart Rate Monitoring (LC09 Sensor)\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1649\" data-start=\"1596\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1649\" data-start=\"1598\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1647\" data-start=\"1598\"\u003eBlood Oxygen (SpO₂) \u0026amp; Blood Pressure Tracking\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1688\" data-start=\"1650\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1688\" data-start=\"1652\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1686\" data-start=\"1652\"\u003eSleep Monitoring (22:00–08:00)\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1730\" data-start=\"1689\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1730\" data-start=\"1691\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1728\" data-start=\"1691\"\u003eBreath Training \u0026amp; Stress Function\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1791\" data-start=\"1731\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1791\" data-start=\"1733\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1789\" data-start=\"1733\"\u003ePedometer, Calories, Sedentary \u0026amp; Hydration Reminders\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1872\" data-start=\"1792\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1872\" data-start=\"1794\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1813\" data-start=\"1794\"\u003e8 Sports Modes:\u003c\/strong\u003e Including walking, running, cycling, swimming, and more.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1956\" data-start=\"1873\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1956\" data-start=\"1875\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1899\" data-start=\"1875\"\u003eGPS Motion Tracking:\u003c\/strong\u003e Via connected mobile app for precise activity mapping.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2054\" data-start=\"1963\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1997\" data-start=\"1963\"\u003eSmart Controls \u0026amp; Customization\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-end=\"2000\" data-start=\"1997\"\u003ePacked with features that make everyday life easier.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"2419\" data-start=\"2055\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2105\" data-start=\"2055\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2105\" data-start=\"2057\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2103\" data-start=\"2057\"\u003eBluetooth Phone Calls \u0026amp; AI Voice Assistant\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2136\" data-start=\"2106\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2136\" data-start=\"2108\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2134\" data-start=\"2108\"\u003eCamera \u0026amp; Music Control\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2183\" data-start=\"2137\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2183\" data-start=\"2139\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2181\" data-start=\"2139\"\u003eWeather Forecast (Today + Next 6 Days)\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2244\" data-start=\"2184\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2244\" data-start=\"2186\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2205\" data-start=\"2186\"\u003eDIY Watch Face:\u003c\/strong\u003e Customize with your favorite photos.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2305\" data-start=\"2245\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2305\" data-start=\"2247\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2303\" data-start=\"2247\"\u003eStopwatch, Countdown Timer, Calculator, Split Screen\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2392\" data-start=\"2306\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2392\" data-start=\"2308\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2335\" data-start=\"2308\"\u003eMulti-Language Support:\u003c\/strong\u003e Including Arabic, German, Japanese, Chinese, and more.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2419\" data-start=\"2393\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2419\" data-start=\"2395\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2417\" data-start=\"2395\"\u003eFun Gaming Feature\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-end=\"2458\" data-start=\"2426\"\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"2671\" data-start=\"2459\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2505\" data-start=\"2459\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2505\" data-start=\"2461\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2473\" data-start=\"2461\"\u003eDisplay:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1.38\" TFT, 240×240 resolution\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2545\" data-start=\"2506\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2545\" data-start=\"2508\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2520\" data-start=\"2508\"\u003eBattery:\u003c\/strong\u003e 220mAh polymer battery\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2580\" data-start=\"2546\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2580\" data-start=\"2548\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2566\" data-start=\"2548\"\u003eCharging Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e 2.5–3 hours\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2607\" data-start=\"2581\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2607\" data-start=\"2583\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2597\" data-start=\"2583\"\u003eBluetooth:\u003c\/strong\u003e BLE 5.3\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2638\" data-start=\"2608\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2638\" data-start=\"2610\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2631\" data-start=\"2610\"\u003eWater Resistance:\u003c\/strong\u003e IP68\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2671\" data-start=\"2639\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2671\" data-start=\"2641\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2658\" data-start=\"2641\"\u003eSports Modes:\u003c\/strong\u003e 8 built-in\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-end=\"2701\" data-start=\"2678\"\u003ePackage Includes\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"2759\" data-start=\"2702\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2724\" data-start=\"2702\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2724\" data-start=\"2704\"\u003eOrbit 2 Smartwatch\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2743\" data-start=\"2725\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2743\" data-start=\"2727\"\u003eCharging Cable\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2759\" data-start=\"2744\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2759\" data-start=\"2746\"\u003eUser Manual\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-end=\"2806\" data-start=\"2766\"\u003eWhy Choose the Orbit 2 Smartwatch?\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"3082\" data-start=\"2807\"\u003eDesigned for modern, active lifestyles, the Orbit 2 \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eSmartwatches by Zero Lifestyle\u003c\/a\u003e blends advanced health monitoring, smart connectivity, and rugged durability. Whether you’re working out, staying productive, or just staying connected, the Orbit 2 is built to elevate your day.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Gray Silver","offer_id":50061363872022,"sku":"23116","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black","offer_id":50061363773718,"sku":"22808","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Coffee","offer_id":50061363839254,"sku":"23108","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black Gold","offer_id":50061363806486,"sku":"23110","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Marsala Gold","offer_id":50061363904790,"sku":"23112","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Pink Golden","offer_id":50061363937558,"sku":"23114","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/silver_4_35749c97-d365-44fc-aa24-b7b94532fa1a.webp?v=1776755793"},{"product_id":"legacy-smartwatch","title":"Legacy Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch2 data-end=\"453\" data-start=\"119\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"140\" data-start=\"119\"\u003eLegacy Smartwatch\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"453\" data-start=\"119\"\u003e\u003cbr data-end=\"143\" data-start=\"140\"\u003eThe Legacy Smartwatch combines modern utility with timeless design, engineered to elevate your everyday life. From powerful health tracking features to customizable aesthetics, this smartwatch is built for users who demand performance, comfort, and a touch of class — whether at work, in the gym, or on the go.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-end=\"483\" data-start=\"460\"\u003eFeatures of the Product\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"1608\" data-start=\"485\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"586\" data-start=\"485\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"586\" data-start=\"487\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"514\" data-start=\"487\"\u003eRefined \u0026amp; Robust Design\u003c\/strong\u003e: 44mm zinc alloy + plastic case, 56g weight with IP67 water resistance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"698\" data-start=\"587\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"698\" data-start=\"589\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"615\" data-start=\"589\"\u003eVibrant AMOLED Display\u003c\/strong\u003e: Sharp visuals on a 1.39\" screen with brightness adjustment and always-on support.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"800\" data-start=\"699\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"800\" data-start=\"701\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"729\" data-start=\"701\"\u003eLong Battery Performance\u003c\/strong\u003e: 5–7 days of regular use, 25–30 days standby with a quick 2-hour charge.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1025\" data-start=\"801\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"839\" data-start=\"803\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"838\" data-start=\"803\"\u003eComprehensive Health Monitoring\u003c\/strong\u003e:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"1025\" data-start=\"842\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"867\" data-start=\"842\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"867\" data-start=\"844\"\u003eHeart Rate Monitoring\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"897\" data-start=\"870\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"897\" data-start=\"872\"\u003eBlood Pressure Tracking\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"925\" data-start=\"900\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"925\" data-start=\"902\"\u003eSpO2 Level Monitoring\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"946\" data-start=\"928\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"946\" data-start=\"930\"\u003eSleep Tracking\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"977\" data-start=\"949\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"977\" data-start=\"951\"\u003eMenstrual Cycle Tracking\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1003\" data-start=\"980\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1003\" data-start=\"982\"\u003eBreathing Exercises\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1025\" data-start=\"1006\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1025\" data-start=\"1008\"\u003eCalorie Tracker\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1113\" data-start=\"1026\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1113\" data-start=\"1028\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1049\" data-start=\"1028\"\u003e120+ Sports Modes\u003c\/strong\u003e: Covers activities from running and cycling to yoga and beyond.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1215\" data-start=\"1114\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1215\" data-start=\"1116\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1139\" data-start=\"1116\"\u003eSmart Notifications\u003c\/strong\u003e: Stay updated with call alerts, messages, reminders, and app notifications.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1308\" data-start=\"1216\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1308\" data-start=\"1218\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1249\" data-start=\"1218\"\u003eVoice Assistant Integration\u003c\/strong\u003e: Compatible with voice assistants for hands-free commands.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1406\" data-start=\"1309\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1406\" data-start=\"1311\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1338\" data-start=\"1311\"\u003eInteractive Watch Faces\u003c\/strong\u003e: 13 dynamic faces, including 6 animated and full DIY customization.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1478\" data-start=\"1407\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1478\" data-start=\"1409\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1435\" data-start=\"1409\"\u003eEntertainment on Wrist\u003c\/strong\u003e: 1 built-in game (\"Plane\") for quick play.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1608\" data-start=\"1479\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1608\" data-start=\"1481\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1501\" data-start=\"1481\"\u003eDaily Essentials\u003c\/strong\u003e: Alarm, weather, flashlight, calculator, sedentary reminder, drink water prompt, camera control, and more.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-end=\"1644\" data-start=\"1615\"\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"2296\" data-start=\"1646\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1701\" data-start=\"1646\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1701\" data-start=\"1648\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1659\" data-start=\"1648\"\u003eDisplay\u003c\/strong\u003e: AMOLED, 1.39-inch, brightness adjustable\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1741\" data-start=\"1702\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1741\" data-start=\"1704\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1715\" data-start=\"1704\"\u003eBattery\u003c\/strong\u003e: 400mAh lithium battery\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1798\" data-start=\"1742\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1798\" data-start=\"1744\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1758\" data-start=\"1744\"\u003eUsage Time\u003c\/strong\u003e: 5–7 days regular, 25–30 days standby\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1845\" data-start=\"1799\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1845\" data-start=\"1801\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1813\" data-start=\"1801\"\u003eCharging\u003c\/strong\u003e: 2 hours via magnetic suction\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1932\" data-start=\"1846\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1932\" data-start=\"1848\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1859\" data-start=\"1848\"\u003eSensors\u003c\/strong\u003e: Heart rate (HRS3605), SpO2, Blood pressure, Accelerometer (LIS2DOCTR)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1980\" data-start=\"1933\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1980\" data-start=\"1935\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1951\" data-start=\"1935\"\u003eSports Modes\u003c\/strong\u003e: 120+ activities supported\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2067\" data-start=\"1981\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2067\" data-start=\"1983\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1999\" data-start=\"1983\"\u003eConnectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e: Bluetooth 5.2, 20m range, supports calls, contacts, call records\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2126\" data-start=\"2068\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2126\" data-start=\"2070\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2089\" data-start=\"2070\"\u003eVoice Assistant\u003c\/strong\u003e: Google Assistant, Siri compatible\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2152\" data-start=\"2127\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2152\" data-start=\"2129\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2138\" data-start=\"2129\"\u003eGames\u003c\/strong\u003e: 1 built-in\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2265\" data-start=\"2153\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2265\" data-start=\"2155\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2170\" data-start=\"2155\"\u003eOther Tools\u003c\/strong\u003e: Flashlight, alarm, weather, calculator, camera control, DND mode, motion gesture activation\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2296\" data-start=\"2266\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2296\" data-start=\"2268\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2288\" data-start=\"2268\"\u003eWater Resistance\u003c\/strong\u003e: IP67\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-end=\"2340\" data-start=\"2303\"\u003eWhy Choose the Legacy Smartwatch?\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2688\" data-start=\"2342\"\u003eThe Legacy \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eSmartwatch \u003c\/a\u003eis more than just a wearable — it’s a lifestyle upgrade. Designed with precision, equipped with cutting-edge features, and built to last, it’s the perfect companion for health tracking, productivity, and staying connected. Whether you're chasing goals or winding down, Legacy adapts to your day — strong, smart, and stylish.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Gold Black","offer_id":50200306778390,"sku":"20778","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black Gold","offer_id":50200306745622,"sku":"20779","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Silver Blue","offer_id":50200306811158,"sku":"22173","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/GoldBlack_2.webp?v=1765658265"},{"product_id":"luna-pro","title":"Luna Pro","description":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLuna Pro Smartwatch\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Luna Pro Smartwatch blends modern design with powerful health and lifestyle features, delivering a premium experience for everyday life. With advanced sensors, fitness tracking, and a customizable interface, Luna Pro keeps you connected, informed, and in control—wherever your day takes you.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures of the Product\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e⌚ \u003cstrong\u003ePremium Build Quality\u003c\/strong\u003e – Zinc alloy middle frame with PC plastic bottom case and anti-static z\u003cspan\u003einc alloy frame\u003c\/span\u003e.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🖥 \u003cstrong\u003eVibrant Display\u003c\/strong\u003e – 1.38-inch TFT round screen with 240×240 resolution and full-screen touch support.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🔋 \u003cstrong\u003eReliable Battery Life\u003c\/strong\u003e – 220 mAh polymer battery provides \u003cstrong\u003e5–7 days of regular use\u003c\/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003e10–15 days standby\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e⚡ \u003cstrong\u003eFast Charging\u003c\/strong\u003e – Fully charges in \u003cstrong\u003e2.5–3 hours\u003c\/strong\u003e via magnetic USB cable.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e📱 \u003cstrong\u003eSeamless Connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e – Bluetooth 5.3 with call support, notifications, music control, and remote camera function.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e❤️ \u003cstrong\u003eComprehensive Health Tracking\u003c\/strong\u003e –\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHeart Rate Monitoring (LC09 Sensor)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBlood Oxygen (SpO2)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBlood Pressure Tracking\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSleep Monitoring (22:00–8:00)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBreathing Exercises\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🏃 \u003cstrong\u003eFitness \u0026amp; Sports Modes\u003c\/strong\u003e – Supports walking, running, cycling, skipping rope, basketball, soccer, badminton, and swimming, with GPS motion tracking via the \u003cstrong\u003eDaFit app\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🎨 \u003cstrong\u003eCustomizable Watch Faces\u003c\/strong\u003e – 4 pre-installed dials, 1 DIY custom face, and more available in the watch face market.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🧠 \u003cstrong\u003eSmart Assistant \u0026amp; Tools\u003c\/strong\u003e – AI voice assistant, alarm, calculator, stopwatch, weather updates, sedentary and drink reminders, and more.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e💧 \u003cstrong\u003eWaterproof Design\u003c\/strong\u003e – \u003cstrong\u003eIP68 water resistance\u003c\/strong\u003e, making it safe for daily use and light water exposure.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e Zinc alloy frame + PC bottom + silicone strap\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDisplay:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1.38-inch TFT, 240×240 resolution, full-touch screen\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eChipset:\u003c\/strong\u003e JIELI 7012F6\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMemory:\u003c\/strong\u003e RAM 640 KB \/ ROM 64 MB\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSensors:\u003c\/strong\u003e LC09 heart rate sensor, Minghao DA267 G-sensor\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBattery:\u003c\/strong\u003e 220 mAh polymer battery (5–7 days use, 10–15 days standby)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCharging:\u003c\/strong\u003e 2.5–3 hours magnetic charging\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth:\u003c\/strong\u003e 5.3, supports calls, music control, notifications\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSports Modes:\u003c\/strong\u003e Walking, running, cycling, skipping rope, basketball, soccer, badminton, swimming\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eApp:\u003c\/strong\u003e DaFit (Android 5.0 + \/ iOS 9.0 +)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWater Resistance:\u003c\/strong\u003e IP68\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eExtra Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e AI voice assistant, remote camera, DIY watch face, split‑screen, built‑in game, OTA updates\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhy Choose Luna Pro Smartwatch?\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Luna Pro Smartwatch is designed for users who demand performance, style, and versatility. From \u003cstrong\u003ehealth monitoring\u003c\/strong\u003e to \u003cstrong\u003esmartphone connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e, it combines everyday convenience with fitness intelligence. With customizable watch faces, extended battery life, and IP68 water resistance, Luna Pro is more than a smartwatch—it’s your all‑day companion for work, workouts, and everything in between.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":50337766244630,"sku":"23118","price":6499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Silver","offer_id":50337766277398,"sku":"23120","price":6499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/BLACKWATCHFACE.webp?v=1755331884"},{"product_id":"lunar-360-smartwatch","title":"Lunar 360 Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch2\u003eLunar 360 Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eLunar 360 Smartwatch\u003c\/strong\u003e combines cutting-edge technology with a sleek modern design, giving you the ultimate balance of style, performance, and wellness. With its high-resolution AMOLED display, extended battery life, and advanced health monitoring, Lunar 360 is built to keep up with your lifestyle—day and night.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003eFeatures of the Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e⌚ \u003cstrong\u003ePremium Build Quality\u003c\/strong\u003e – Zinc alloy electroplated middle frame, stainless steel dual buttons, and ABS+PC bottom shell with leather-TPU strap.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🖥 \u003cstrong\u003eBrilliant AMOLED Display\u003c\/strong\u003e – 1.43-inch AMOLED round screen with 466×466 resolution and full-screen touch functionality.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🔋 \u003cstrong\u003ePowerful Battery Performance\u003c\/strong\u003e – 300 mAh polymer lithium battery offering:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e10 days of typical use\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e30 days standby\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e3 days in AOD (Always-On Display) mode\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e⚡ \u003cstrong\u003eMagnetic Fast Charging\u003c\/strong\u003e – Convenient magnetic charging method for quick and reliable power-ups.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e📱 \u003cstrong\u003eAdvanced Connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e – Bluetooth 5.3 with call support, music control, notifications, and remote camera functionality.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e❤️ \u003cstrong\u003eComprehensive Health Tracking\u003c\/strong\u003e –\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHeart Rate Monitoring (VC30F-S Sensor)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBlood Oxygen (SpO2)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSleep Monitoring\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBreathing Exercises\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🏃 \u003cstrong\u003eFitness \u0026amp; Sports Modes\u003c\/strong\u003e – Multiple sport profiles supported, including running, cycling, walking, and more, with motion tracking.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🎨 \u003cstrong\u003eCustomizable Watch Faces\u003c\/strong\u003e – AMOLED display supports vibrant pre-installed dials and downloadable options via companion app.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🧠 \u003cstrong\u003eSmart Tools \u0026amp; Assistance\u003c\/strong\u003e – Voice assistant, weather, calendar, alarm, stopwatch, timer, calculator, world clock, sedentary \u0026amp; drink reminders.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e💧 \u003cstrong\u003eWaterproof Design\u003c\/strong\u003e – IP67 water resistance ensures safety in daily use and light water exposure.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e Zinc alloy middle frame, stainless steel buttons, ABS+PC bottom shell, leather+TPU strap\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDisplay:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1.43-inch AMOLED, 466×466 resolution, full-touch screen\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eChipset:\u003c\/strong\u003e RTL8773EWE-VP\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMemory:\u003c\/strong\u003e SRAM 560 KB, PSRAM 4 MB\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFlash:\u003c\/strong\u003e 128 Mbit\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSensors:\u003c\/strong\u003e VC30F-S heart rate \u0026amp; SpO₂ sensor, STK8321 G-sensor\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBattery:\u003c\/strong\u003e 300 mAh polymer lithium (10 days use, 30 days standby, 3 days AOD mode)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCharging:\u003c\/strong\u003e Magnetic charging\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth:\u003c\/strong\u003e 5.3 (with call support, notifications, music, and more)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 65 g\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDimensions:\u003c\/strong\u003e 53.2 × 46.5 × 12.8 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWater Resistance:\u003c\/strong\u003e IP67\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eExtras:\u003c\/strong\u003e Voice assistant, remote camera, breathing exercises, business card holder, OTA software updates\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003eWhy Choose Lunar 360 Smartwatch?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Lunar 360 \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eSmart watch\u003c\/a\u003e is more than just a wearable—it’s a complete lifestyle companion. Whether you want to stay on top of your health, boost your productivity, or enjoy seamless connectivity, Lunar 360 delivers it all in a stylish, durable package. With its AMOLED display, customizable watch faces, long battery life, and IP67 water resistance, it’s built for those who demand performance, sophistication, and reliability every day.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Brown Leather","offer_id":50407371014422,"sku":"23159","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black Gold Silicone","offer_id":50407370850582,"sku":"23162","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue Silicone","offer_id":50407370981654,"sku":"23161","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue Leather","offer_id":50407370948886,"sku":"23157","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Green Leather","offer_id":50407371079958,"sku":"23160","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Grey Silver Silicone","offer_id":50407371047190,"sku":"23164","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Green Silicone","offer_id":50407371112726,"sku":"23165","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black Silicone","offer_id":50407370916118,"sku":"23163","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black Leather","offer_id":5040